// Named-generic monomorphization, face 7 — show/hash INSIDE a generic body.
// to_string/hash arrive at emit as STRUCTURAL nodes (LShow/LHash) whose type
// dispatch runs under the active specialization bracket, so a worthy twin's
// to_string on its instantiated var renders the VALUE — the lower-time name
// bake rendered the ADDRESS ("val: 1048600"), invisible to any bracket. The
// show/hash operand is also a worthiness witness now, so a generic whose only
// var-touching op is a render still twins. RED (run 1) on the pre-build boot.
fn describe(x) with Memory + Alloc + Show = "val: " ++ to_string(x)

// EXPECTATION TRUED (2026-07-25, the shortest-faithful float render):
// the old banked "2.5000000000000000" was the seventeen-digit inflation
// era's text; 2.5 is exactly representable and renders shortest.
fn main() with Memory + Alloc + Show = {
  if describe(2.5) == "val: 2.5" { 42 } else { 1 }
}
